# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AURELIS — .env.example  (placeholders ONLY — commit this file)
#
# V1 IS LOCAL-FIRST AND USES NO ENVIRONMENT SECRETS.
# The frontend must never read an API key, token, or credential.
# This file exists only to document FUTURE (post-V1) backend config,
# and to make it obvious that real secrets go in an untracked .env.
#
# NEVER put real values here. NEVER commit a real .env.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Build (safe, non-secret; used by Vite for GitHub Pages base path) ──
# Example: "/aurelis/" when deploying to https://<user>.github.io/aurelis/
VITE_BASE_PATH="/"

# ── FUTURE / backend only (NOT used in V1, NOT read by the client) ──
# These belong to a future private backend service, never the static app.
# Leave blank in V1.
# AURELIS_API_BASE_URL=""        # future backend endpoint
# AURELIS_AI_PROVIDER=""         # future private AI provider name
# AURELIS_AI_API_KEY=""          # future — server-side ONLY, never client
